? (whynot increment-count)

Production INCREMENT-COUNT does NOT match.
(P INCREMENT-COUNT
   =GOAL>
       SUM =SUM
       COUNT =COUNT
   =RETRIEVAL>
       NUMBER =SUM
       NEXT =NEWCOUNT
 ==>
   =GOAL>
       COUNT =NEWCOUNT
   +RETRIEVAL>
       NUMBER =SUM
)
It fails because: 
The value in the NUMBER slot of the chunk in the RETRIEVAL buffer does not satisfy the constraints.
